# docs/specs/09-fuzzing.md §4.2 "Committed-record rule" (review edit E4):
# raw fuzz-matrix reports are machine-local and gitignored; the committed
# record is the collector's scoreboard row (docs/reports/metrics/), not a
# snapshot of this directory.
/reports/

